cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AICleanBot: An Open-Source ESP32-S3 Robot with On-Device Semantic Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  An open-source line-following cleaning robot built on a single ESP32-S3.
  A lightweight INT8-quantized U-Net runs on-device to segment the guide line
  from a 160x120 grayscale camera frame, and a PID controller turns the
  centroid error into differential wheel speeds. The repository ships the
  firmware, the training and quantization pipeline, the dataset, the hardware
  design files and a WeChat mini-program host, so the whole loop from data
  capture to on-device inference can be reproduced without a cloud GPU.
version: 1.0.0
